{"line":"T76.C.04","text":"Der Vorzug ist, dass sich die Frage entscheiden lässt, was selten ist. Die Schwächen: Checklisten werden ausgereizt, und Goodharts Gesetz übernimmt. Der Turing-Test misst zum Teil Geschick im Täuschen. Und der Robotik-Punkt bindet „allgemeine Intelligenz“ an Hände, was näher an Jeffs Beschwerde ist, als er zugeben würde.","lufs":-18.95,"alignment":{"characters":["D","e","r"," ","V","o","r","z","u","g"," ","i","s","t",","," ","d","a","s","s"," ","s","i","c","h"," ","d","i","e"," ","F","r","a","g","e"," ","e","n","t","s","c","h","e","i","d","e","n"," ","l","ä","s","s","t",","," ","w","a","s"," ","s","e","l","t","e","n"," ","i","s","t","."," ","D","i","e"," ","S","c","h","w","ä","c","h","e","n",":"," ","C","h","e","c","k","l","i","s","t","e","n"," ","w","e","r","d","e","n"," ","a","u","s","g","e","r","e","i","z","t",","," ","u","n","d"," ","G","o","o","d","h","a","r","t","s"," ","G","e","s","e","t","z"," ","ü","b","e","r","n","i","m","m","t","."," ","D","e","r"," ","T","u","r","i","n","g","-","T","e","s","t"," ","m","i","s","s","t"," ","z","u","m"," ","T","e","i","l"," ","G","e","s","c","h","i","c","k"," ","i","m"," ","T","ä","u","s","c","h","e","n","."," ","U","n","d"," ","d","e","r"," ","R","o","b","o","t","i","k","-","P","u","n","k","t"," ","b","i","n","d","e","t"," ","„","a","l","l","g","e","m","e","i","n","e"," ","I","n","t","e","l","l","i","g","e","n","z","“"," ","a","n"," ","H","ä","n","d","e",","," ","w","a","s"," ","n","ä","h","e","r"," ","a","n"," ","J","e","f","f","s"," ","B","e","s","c","h","w","e","r","d","e"," ","i","s","t",","," ","a","l","s"," ","e","r"," ","z","u","g","e","b","e","n"," ","w","ü","r","d","e","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.027,0.053,0.08,0.16,0.24,0.32,0.4,0.48,0.56,0.64,0.72,0.8,0.88,0.96,1.2,1.232,1.264,1.296,1.328,1.36,1.392,1.424,1.456,1.488,1.52,1.56,1.6,1.64,1.68,1.747,1.813,1.88,1.947,2.013,2.08,2.128,2.176,2.224,2.272,2.32,2.354,2.389,2.423,2.457,2.491,2.526,2.56,2.627,2.693,2.76,2.827,2.893,